<title>USA: Kimberly-Clark share increase approved.</title>
<headline>Kimberly-Clark share increase approved.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberly-Clark Corp said its stockholders approved an increase in the company's authorized common shares to 1.2 billion, from 600 million.</p>
</text>
